hed by niggers for a laugh or my guns being seized. YET! Those who stand for anything stand for nothing.</p>"],[6,22019598,22019556,0,0,0,"2020-01-05T22:56:26","TimMasson1","",[],"<p>dude, we are talking about random numbers on a web forum. he isn't hurting anyone and its such a non issue. I have noticed you tend to think in extremes, all or nothing. Thats not a knock at all but there are nuances in life and some dork shit posting is nothing to get upset over my friend.</p>"],[1,22019404,0,0,0,0,"2020-01-05T22:40:44","VandalayIndustries","",[],"<p>Well, the resident moron supports this, so....what’s that say?</p>"],[2,22019489,22019404,0,0,0,"2020-01-05T22:47:19","TimMasson1","",[],"<p>whatcha ya gonna do bout it big fella?</p>"],[3,22034045,22019489,0,0,0,"2020-01-06T23:56:15","VandalayIndustries","",[],"<p>Well....I am limited to blocking the subverses little guy. So, I did.</p>\n<p>Maybe you can go find a cock to gag on? May help you with your need to white knight a faggot.</p>"],[4,22034374,22034045,0,0,0,"2020-01-07T00:22:27","TimMasson1","",[],"<p>Something like this should not cause you so much anger to the point where you're going to insult a stranger. You should master your emotions a little bit better.</p>"],[5,22063223,22034374,0,0,0,"2020-01-09T01:38:05","VandalayIndustries","",[],"<p>Why? It’s the fucking internet you dumb fuck. Do you think there are ramifications to calling someone a faggot here?</p>\n<p>Stupid fuck.</p>"],[6,22063398,22063223,0,0,0,"2020-01-09T02:02:24","TimMasson1","",[],"<p>I was just trying to help you, I'm your friend 😊</p>"],[7,22063416,22063398,0,0,0,"2020-01-09T02:04:17","VandalayIndustries","",[],"<p>Ok.</p>\n<p>Tit for tat. Some life advice for you. Spend less time here. You live on this site. Maybe even get your cherry popped.</p>"],[8,22063455,22063416,0,0,0,"2020-01-09T02:07:31","TimMasson1","",[],"<p>I like being here and I do what I like. Thanks for the advice though 😊</p>"],[2,22020459,22019404,0,0,0,"2020-01-05T23:55:29","Drstrangepepper","",[],"<p>no you</p>"],[1,22019438,0,0,0,0,"2020-01-05T22:43:13","FireCrackLover","",[],"<p>I've done some analysis and these are not random.</p>\n<p>Humans - ferengi.gif - are not capable of generating a sequential list of numbers that follow a random distribution. \r</p>\n<p>Neither are computers, which actually contain a predetermined list of random numbers.</p>\n<p>Even with a dice physical flaws would invalidate results.</p>"],[2,22019481,22019438,0,0,0,"2020-01-05T22:46:46","TimMasson1","",[],"<p>you are correct</p>"],[2,22019538,22019438,0,0,0,"2020-01-05T22:51:25","BillyLuath","",[],"<blockquote>\n<p>Neither are computers, which actually contain a predetermined list of random numbers. </p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>It depends on the what is generating the number, If the number is picked at random from a predetermined list of possible numbers, then it's not as random as a system that uses CPU clock cycles.</p>"],[3,22020451,22019538,0,0,0,"2020-01-05T23:54:58","Drstrangepepper","",[],"<p>well this is interesting</p>"]]
